{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\ude9c Farm Life Simulator \u2013 Build, Grow, Thrive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Farm Life Simulator</strong>, where you can <strong>shape your own farm</strong>, cultivate crops, raise animals, and create a thriving homestead in a dynamic open world. With <strong>full freedom to build, expand, and explore</strong>, every farm is unique\u2014grow it <strong>your way</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfe1 Build &amp; Expand Your Dream Farm</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place <strong>buildings, barns, fences, and coops</strong> wherever you like with <strong>free placement</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade and expand your land\u2014<strong>start small and grow into a massive farm</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your farm with <strong>decorations, signs, and crafted structures</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf3e Plant, Grow, and Harvest Crops</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Plow fields</strong>, plant <strong>a variety of crops</strong>, and manage soil conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Water, fertilize, and care for</strong> your plants to ensure a bountiful harvest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience <strong>realistic crop growth</strong>\u2014plants progress over time and can wither if neglected.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weather matters!</strong> Rain can <strong>water crops naturally</strong>, while dry seasons require extra care.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc04 Raise &amp; Care for Animals</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Own and manage <strong>chickens, cows, and other farm animals</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Feed, water, and care for</strong> them to keep them happy and productive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chickens <strong>lay eggs</strong>, cows <strong>produce milk</strong>, and animals react to their environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build pens, coops, and pastures to create <strong>the perfect home</strong> for your animals.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\ude9c Use Tractors &amp; Tools to Work the Land</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive and use <strong>tractors, plows, mowers, and planting tools</strong> to cultivate fields.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mow overgrown grass</strong>, <strong>till soil</strong>, and <strong>harvest crops</strong> with realistic equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your farming gear to <strong>increase efficiency</strong> and unlock new mechanics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Craft, Build, and Upgrade</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gather resources</strong> to craft essential tools, decorations, and farm structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expand your capabilities</strong> with upgraded equipment and advanced farming tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create <strong>functional farm buildings</strong> to store items, process goods, and more.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udcb0 Sell, Trade, and Build Your Farm\u2019s Economy</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell your crops, animal products, and crafted goods to earn money.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use profits to <strong>expand your farm</strong>, <strong>buy new equipment</strong>, and <strong>unlock new content</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit the <strong>Farmer\u2019s Market</strong> to <strong>buy new seeds, items, and farm supplies</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf0e A Living, Breathing Farming World</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Day/Night cycle &amp; changing seasons</strong> affect gameplay and farming strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore beyond your farm</strong>\u2014visit markets, neighbours, buy new supplies, and expand your business.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No restrictions, no forced goals</strong>\u2014play at <strong>your own pace</strong> and shape your own experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to build the <strong>ultimate farm</strong>? <strong>Wishlist now and start your journey in</strong> <i>Farm Life Simulator</i>! \ud83d\ude9c\ud83c\udf3f</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585520?t=1742569820","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585520?t=1742569820","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585520/e0adac4bd104159373a825de5cea1e86183fd5c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742569820","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585520/e0adac4bd104159373a825de5cea1e86183fd5c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742569820","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\ude9c Farm Life Simulator \u2013 Build, Grow, Thrive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Farm Life Simulator</strong>, where you can <strong>shape your own farm</strong>, cultivate crops, raise animals, and create a thriving homestead in a dynamic open world. With <strong>full freedom to build, expand, and explore</strong>, every farm is unique\u2014grow it <strong>your way</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 cl